<title>USA: Central European buys Ukraine studio stake.</title>
<headline>Central European buys Ukraine studio stake.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Central European Media Enterprises Ltd said it completed its purchase of a 50-percent equity interest in Ukraine's Studio 1 + 1 group of companies.</p>
<p>The company did not give details of the acquisition.</p>
<p>But it said Studio 1 + 1 provided 50 hours of programming broadcast every week during prime time on Ukraine's state broadcaster UTV Channel 1.</p>
<p>The channel reached 98 percent of the country's 51.9 million people, it added.</p>
</text>
